<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Manitowoc upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Manitowoc upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst Blair Brumley said he upgraded Manitowoc Co to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the company -- which makes food service equipment, cranes and boom trucks and provides marine repair services -- were off 1/4 to 35-1/8 late Tuesday afternoon.  </p>
<p>&quot;We look for more margin enhancement going forward and continued growth in the crane operations,&quot; Brumley said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
